      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i dont really want to go to the er or anything if i dont have to, its kinda expensive and i have work in an hour. i feel like i must have just eaten something i'm allergic to or its just the pollen. if i just take a double dose of benadryl will that clear it up fast enough??",
